This hostname currently sends max-age=0 on the hashed JS (no nosniff).
Workers /assets/* is restored to public, max-age=31536000, immutable (Vite
hashed assets) and keeps nosniff. ACAO * is on static paths because live
sends it on both / and the hashed JS file.

